WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.543
- Can I get a medium coffee.

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:02.463
- [Barista] Sure.

00:00:02.463 --> 00:00:04.097
- Actually what has the most caffeine?

00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:06.350
- [Barista] We've got a grande macchiato

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.360
with like some colombian beans...

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.808
- [Man] Did I turn the stove off?

00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:12.135
(hip hop music)

00:00:12.135 --> 00:00:12.968
- [Redhead] Hey.

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:13.801
- Hey.

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.039
How are you?
- Good, you?

00:00:15.039 --> 00:00:16.632
- [Redhead] Good, did I tell you the news about my cat?

00:00:16.632 --> 00:00:17.465
- No.

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:18.663
Oh (beep) what's her name?

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:19.970
I don't remember, (beep).

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:23.200
(phone ringing)

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.593
- We're just gonna wait for a few more people.

00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:30.073
- [Female] Am I supposed to be in this meeting?

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.850
- [Male] Oh wait, I didn't even make breakfast

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.132
that's why I'm at the coffee shop.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.100
- [Female] Oh (beep) what was she talking about?

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.280
- [Blonde Woman] I don't even like this job.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.761
- [Male] All the days just blend together.

00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:39.440
- [Female] I can't even pick out key words.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.503
- [Blonde Woman] I won't be surprised if I got fired.

00:00:40.503 --> 00:00:42.172
- [Male] Oh no, I have to poop.

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:43.960
- [Blonde Woman] They definitely think I'm an (beep)hole.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:44.793
- [Female] I should probably stop

00:00:44.793 --> 00:00:45.950
thinking to myself, if i'm going to hear her.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:47.010
- [Male] Don't poop at work.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:47.990
- [Blonde Woman] My best friend isn't even really

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.820
my best friend, she has like three other best friends right?

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.653
- [Male] What if the bathroom is full?

00:00:50.653 --> 00:00:51.486
I'll hold it.

00:00:51.486 --> 00:00:52.487
Or is that how people get sepsis?

00:00:52.487 --> 00:00:53.930
I need to see a doctor.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:54.763
- [Female] I need to see a therapist.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.020
- [Blonde Woman] I need a drink.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.420
- [Female] How am I getting older and not getting smarter?

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.950
- [Male] Doctor's gonna tell me I'm dying.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.290
- [Blonde Woman] Oh god, what is my mom doing?

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.207
She hasn't called in a few days.

00:01:02.207 --> 00:01:03.178
Shut up.

00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:04.167
- [Female] Shut up.

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.000
- [Male] Shut the (beep) up.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.898
- [Female] Oh my god, I'm glad no one can hear my thoughts.

00:01:06.898 --> 00:01:08.600
- [Blonde Woman] No one can hear my thoughts, right?

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.433
- [Man] Who's that?

00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:10.266
- [Blonde Woman] Who's that?

00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:11.099
- [Female] Oh no.

00:01:11.099 --> 00:01:11.932
People can hear my thoughts I knew it.

00:01:11.932 --> 00:01:12.765
- [Male] I'm losing my mind.

00:01:12.765 --> 00:01:13.598
- [Blonde Woman] Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:14.431
- [Man] Maybe.

00:01:14.431 --> 00:01:15.264
- [Female] Mind orgy.

00:01:15.264 --> 00:01:16.097
- [Male] What?

00:01:16.097 --> 00:01:17.184
- [Voiceover] Mind orgy.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.293
- [Woman In Suit] Kelsey.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.980
- [Redhead] I should probably keep going there right?

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.570
- Yeah.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:27.920
There you go.
- Thank you.

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:29.503
- [Barista] Sir?

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.273
- Kelsey?

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:33.470
- Can I get you something to drink?

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:37.130
- I just gotta, I gotta, I gotta quit so...

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.483
- Okay.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:39.853
- [Barista] Sir.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.753
- I uh, I left my stove on.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:47.154
(curious music)

